  Description: You came to Alkenstar because you heard they had guns, but you stayed
    because of the atmosphere. Or the guns. Either way, journalism and scientific
    curiosity opened the door to a life of adventure. Now you continue to adventure
    in the Alkenstar area, using your skills to deal with whatever situations present
    themselves. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Charisma
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in Society and Engineering
    Lore. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Streetwise] skill feat.
